
Quota OS microkernel
Version: 016 (ac565ac)
基于三级资源声明的微内核，
保证一级任务永远不卡顿、二级任务运行不卡顿，三级任务则不保证。
[boot] EL1h, MMU off. No hardware isolation.
[boot] x0=0x44000000 physical RAM span 128 MB (probed)
[boot] DTB at 0x44000000
[boot] DTB snapshot 7512 bytes (header said 1048576)
[boot] DTB memory 134217728 bytes
[boot] system reserve 350 us/period, 16384 KB;
       tier-1 1500 us/period, 13312 KB; guard 80 us/period
[boot] EL1 identity map, when on, is not separate-process isolation. Three-tier hardware isolation is not claimed.
[boot] cache colors: 32 (model: 2 MB 16-way cache, 4 KB pages);
       tier-1 pages in 7 own colors, padding 11776 KB
[boot] kernel image+bss 1641 KB of the 16384 KB system reserve
[boot] GICv2 from DTB: distributor 0x8000000, cpu interface 0x8010000
[boot] CNTFRQ 62500000 Hz (1 tick = 16 ns), virtual timer PPI 27
[boot] clock: host time (not icount; timings are reference only)
[boot] simulated device IRQ line: EL1 physical timer, PPI 30
[boot] tier-1 display-vsync and timer-server bound to their slots
[boot] slot table from tick 32500000, period 625000 ticks, guard 1250 ticks
[boot] shell task running
[dev] 3 new simulated devices start in Tier 3; verifying
      (8 jobs, 8 aborts each, IRQs masked, before the next guard)
[dev] sim-dma: job 396/400 us, stop 24/20 us (measured/declared)
      [非 icount，仅供参考]
[dev] sim-blk: job 1991/2000 us, stop 1770/2000 us (measured/declared)
      [非 icount，仅供参考]
[dev] sim-cam: job 291/300 us, stop 7/30 us (measured/declared)
      [非 icount，仅供参考]
[health] sim-dma 实测超出声明 (verify stop): measured 24 us > declared 20 us,
  period 0; sim-dma demoted to Tier 3 [非 icount，仅供参考]
[health] display-vsync: sim-dma Tier 1 revoked (实测超出声明);
  policy degrade -> Tier 3
